<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">ZEKHARIAH</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="toc2">ZEKHARIAH</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zek</para>
  <para style="mt1">ZEKHARIAH</para>
  <para style="mt2">Zechariah</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">Zekhariah ccauh hynh phuin ning lang phia kho athua: (1) Byaria 1-8 kyahin, BC 520 te 518 laku kya profeh Zekhariah nynh a hopaw bya a um. E bya hae alunghua tuh vizin muihnaw te thua zah, Jerusalem raethuinaw, Beikinn sakthuinaw, Pachia ccungccaw hae thyaasahnaw te yn thua cih paw Messiah ccyh kong nynh thua. (2) Byaria 9-14 kyahin, ngaehoi athuapaw Messiah kong te nyathyakou byapianaw kong ccakhungpaw bya kha a um.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Raeringnaw pyanaw bya te ngaehoinaw bya 1.1—8.23</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel innpaw hae tungvaw byapianaw 9.1-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Malang kaethungnaw te daenaw 9.9—14.21</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel kha Ngaesiku lan Hyynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darias nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum ningnaw, sawpaw sah taryanaw khe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Iddo ccapaw Berekhiah, Berekhiah ccapaw profeh Zekhariah kalan khe yn thua zah a hopaw tuh:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 4:24-5:1">Ezr 4.24—5.1</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 6:14">6.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh na minpaaw hae tungvaw a thin myarya ria. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha minmin kalan hynhte hopah hae: Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh ka kalan yn ki oh lah, nae kalan kae kiru cih, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="4" style="v" />Nae minpaaw hae te lokuh nan oh. Langmawlya e profeh hae nynh minmin kha, “Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, ahoy leipaw nae hiinzia te ahoy leipaw nae cyisahnaw kyate oun ki oh,” cite a hopya hae. Thuasalama minmin nynh yn thaepah khyh hae, pawlang yn ria khyh hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nae minpaaw hae tuh teimou a um vae hae? Te Profeh hae so zungzae a hiin hae tou? <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama ka ryalahtu profeh hae kya kaw ka pya hae paw ka bya te ka phungbya hae nynh nae minpaaw hae kha phah khyh hae tou? Tukeiccuze minmin nynh ngaesikuh hae zah, “Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh cyi lan a paccyn hawte, aening hiinzia te cyisahnaw thyhte aening tungvaw a cyi vae,” cite a ho hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Masaty Vizin: Marang Ccikuh hae paw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Darias nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum ningnaw, sawpaw sah haw lae kheitnaw Shebat sawpaw, nin kuin lae pali nin khe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Iddo ccapaw Berekhiah, Berekhiah ccapaw profeh Zekhariah kalan khe yn thua; Zekhariah nynh a hopaw tuh, <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuazi khe marang sepaw a ccikuhpaw ccungccapaw lu kheit kha ka muih! Tuh-e paw tuh accya kya-e myrte thingku hae laku khe a thadyn; a nulang khe asepaw, puakakaepaw te arawpaw marang hae a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:2-8">Bya 6.2-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Te kae nynh, “Ka bawipaw, e hae hynh pawmou athua hae?” ka cipya. Bya kae hokuhpaw vaawpaw nynh kae kha, “Pawmou athua hae cipaw kha kae muihsah cih,” yn cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Myrte thingku hae laku a thadynpaw ccungccapaw nynh, “Minmin tuh laephi pynpi kya ccia bungthung khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a saw hae paw nynh thua,” a ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te minmin nynh myrte thingku hae laku a thadynpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw kha, “Laephi kya kae cceih bungthung vae, laephi pynpi tuh daerarin lan a um,” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh, “Pou vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, hynh-e kum sung sari lungkhu na thinrianuapaw Jerusalem te Judah khuapi hae hynh hohseciamou thawcci leite na um cih hae?” a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae te bya kae hokuhpaw vaawpaw kha bya hoypaw te lungtangnaw bya khate bya a khung. <verse number="14" style="v" />Bya kae hokuhpaw vaawpaw nynh kae kha yn hopah zah, E bya hynh siakhae ccavae: Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, Kae tuh Jerusalem te Zion hanlan myarya ka eiung. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngaengante um hae paw minphuin hae tungvaw myaryamaw ka thinria; pawccecize thawte ka thinria khyh lyakhe minmin nynh hoyleinaw kha houh a rae hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte aho, Jerusalem kha ngaethyaumsahte ka kinua vae; a lungkhu khe ka inn kha sak athua cih, Jerusalem kha tounawpaw arui te tou athua cih, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh siakhae lanpaw bya yn hopyapaw tuh, Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Ka khuapi hae tuh paepae lui lan bua a hoirum cih hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Zion kha lungtangnaw bua a pya cih zah Jerusalem kha bua a po cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Vaeningnaw Vizin: Saki hae te Sosuhtu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka dothung zah saki ki pali kha ka muih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Bya kae hokuhpaw vaawpaw kha, “E hae hynh pawmou athua hae?” cite ka khia. Te aning nynh, “E hae tuh Judah ram, Israel ram te Jerusalem khua kha phiariphiarae a phiasakuh hae paw saki hae nynh thua hae,” cite yn khung. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh sosuhtu hae lu pali kha yn muihsah. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te kae nynh, “Minmin hynh paw ryalaw lan mou oun ccia hae?” cite ka khia zah, vaawpaw nynh, “E saki hae tuh, a lu a hang khopaw lu kheit san a um khyh ccaw cite Judah kha phiariphiarae a phiasakuhpaw saki hae nynh thua hae; thuasalama, e sosuhtu hae tuh minmin kha risah khylan, te Judah ccungccaw hae kha phiariphiarae nung khylan Judah ram kha rawsete mih ki a hangnua hae paw minphuin hae ki kha khya khylan oun thua vae hae,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Vaethumnaw Vizin: Arui te A Toupaw Ccungccapaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka dothung zah a kuih kya tounawpaw arui a ccyngpaw ccungccapaw lu kheit kha ka muih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te kae nynh, “Teilangmou na cceih cih?” cite ka khia zah, aning nynh, “Jerusalem khua akopaw te asaepaw kha tou lan ka cceih cih,” a ci. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te bya kae hokuhpaw vaawpaw tuh malang yn cceih, te ccangpaw vaawpaw lu kheit nynh amaw kha tungku khylan cciadue zah, <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ccue lah, khuh-e ccangvaepaw khuh hopya tua: Jerusalem kya ccungccaw zapi te sarangpaw hae a um hae keiccuze khualungrua a um leipaw khua hae kya um hawte, Jerusalem kya a um cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh, Kae tuh khua po voilu lan a koihpaw maee lungrua ka thua cih zah, khua lungkhu kya umpaw phu-enaw ka thua cih, a ci cite la hopah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ngianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tho oh, tho oh! Thahlang e ram kyate ccue oh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci; pawccecize vaawlui zakaw aki ki pali hae hawte phiariphiarae kae nung vae oh, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tho oh! Babilon ccanung kya um hae paw nanning, Zion lang ccue oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nanning ae luade oh paw minphuin hae te asekuh lante vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> (a phu-enaw nynh kae kha yn saw koute) hynhte a ho: Thanccingte, nanning ae ty oh paw nynh ka mitlungdy kha yn ty vae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin kha ka kuih ka hangnua cih hae zah, minmin tuh mih see hae hanlan a luade hae paw uccaw lang a tang cih hae. Tetuh kae hynh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn saw cipaw na nyh vae cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pou Zion ccanung, hlawsah lah, na lungtua sah! Pawccecize kae cceih zah na ngaelung kya ka um cih, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh, minphuin patae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya a kyngkuh cih hae zah ka ccungccaw athua cih hae; te na ngaelung kya ka um cih. vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae hynh na kalan yn saw cipaw na nyh cih. <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ram thyaapaw kyakhe Judah kha a hanpaw lante rho lang a ccou cih zah, Jerusalem kha bua a po cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang daebabi lan um oh; pawccecize aning tuh a umnaw hmin thyaapaw kyate a thokuh vae.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Vaepalinaw Vizin: Joshua te Satan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw malang a thadynpaw ranpibawi lupi Joshua te amaw kha seibe khylan a ranglang a thadynpaw Satan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Satan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh rawsetu khyhze seibetu cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> kha yn muihsah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:2">Ezr 5.2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:10">Bya 12.10</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Satan kha, “Pou Satan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha kae pe! Jerusalem a potu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha kae pe! E ccungccapaw hynh maee kyate poh thuaapaw ccungngue thua khyh tou?” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:9">Jud 9</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Joshua tuh athupaw boeining kha lawkuh zah vaawpaw malang a thadyn. <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh a malang a thadyn hae paw kha, “Athupaw a boeining hynh khahpah oh,” a cipya hae. Te aning nynh Joshua kha, “Dotua, na seimenaw kha ccaring kae lawpya vae, nang kha boeining hoypaw kae lawsakuh cih,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te kae nynh, “A lu vawlan athyaapaw pungde khungsah hae sah,” cite ka ho. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh athyaapaw pungde kha a lu vawlan khungsah hae zah boeining kha a lawsahku hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh a pe khe a thadyn.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Joshua kha tynkaring lan bya hopah zah, <verse number="7" style="v" />“Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nang nynh ka laanpi kha na zui zah, ka rya na law zetuh, ka inn kha na uk cih zah ka voidu kha na do-oih cih, e kya a thadyn hae paw laku kya teenaw kaw te pounaw kaw kae pya cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pou ranpibawi lupi Joshua, nang te na malang a haung hae paw na ban hae ryte ngaetua oh! Minmin tuh yn cyihkuh cih paw muihsahnaw nynh athua hae: Ka seepaw Thingkaran kha ka thuakhae cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5">Jer 23.5</ref>, <ref loc="JER 33:15">33.15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:12">Zek 6.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Joshua malang ka nungpaw lung kha dotua oh, khah-e lung ccangkheit kya mitmae ccangsari a um, khah-e lung vawlan khe karynte ccaw ka zei cih, e ram a seimenaw kha nin kheit lungkhu ka vuapah cih, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuin nin khe nanning nynh nae misu ku te nae thaeku ku kaw lang ccia khylan lu kheit te lu kheit na kokuh cih oh, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci,” cite a hopya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 4:4">Mik 4.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Thing hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bya kae hokuhpaw vaawpaw tuh bua yn thua zah, a ihpaw ccungccaw tho hawte, kae kha yn tho. <verse number="2" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha, “Pawmou na muih?” cite yn khia zah, kae nynh, “Sui mawcci te raepaw maeekhuatung kha ka muih, tuh-e a dung khe pakekhupaw ccangkheit, maeekhua ccangsari, tuh-e pakekhupaw te tuh-e maeekhua ccangsari piadenawpaw paih ccangsari a um. <verse number="3" style="v" />Maeekhuatung a pe khe oliv thingku ku ning um zah, pakekhupaw a voi a rang khe ku kheit cci a um,” cite ka ho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:4">Bya 11.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Bya kae hokuhpaw vaawpaw kha, “Ka bawipaw, e hae hynh pawmou athua hae?” cite ka khia. <verse number="5" style="v" />Bya kae hokuhpaw vaawpaw nynh kae kha, “E hae hynh pawmou athua hae cipaw na nyh khyh hae tou?” yn cipah zah, kae nynh, “Ka bawipaw, ka nyh khyh hae,” ka cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh kae kha, “E hynh Zerubbabel kalan yn thuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya nynh thua: Thungnaw liate thua khyh, huhan liate mah thua khyh, ka muisaw liate nynh thua, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:2">Ezr 5.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Pou mua lepaw, nang tuh pawmou na thua? Zerubbabel malang khe bialae lang na tang cih; ccungccaw hae nynh, ‘Apuithya, Apuithya!’ cite a sia lya hae khe, aning nynh beikinn adungparyh lung kha a khang cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah, <verse number="9" style="v" />“E inn aleihpaw kha Zerubbabel nynh a bing vae; aning nynh inn hynh phe a lyn cih. Tetuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae hynh nae kalan yn saw cipaw na nyh cih oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ryalaw adihpaw law ccyh lyaze pawlang a ria lei hae paw miakaw nynh mih lungtua cih zah, Zerubbabel kuih kya-e tounawpaw arui kha a muih cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10b: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:6">Bya 5.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">“E maeekhua ccangsari tuh laephi pynpi po lekuh lan a muih hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mit hae nynh athua hae,” a ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te kae nynh, “Maeekhuatung a voi a rang um hae paw hynh-e oliv thingku ku ning hae hynh pawmou athua hae?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:4">Bya 11.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Te chitui bunawpaw sui paih ccangning nynh chitui a bu hae paw hynh-e oliv ku akaran ran ning hae hynh pawmou athua hae?” cite ka khia. <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh kae kha, “E hae hynh pawmou athua hae cipaw na nyh khyh tou?” cite yn khia zah kae nynh, “Ka bawipaw, ka nyh khyh,” ka cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh aning nynh, “E hae tuh laephi pynpi kya-e Bawipaw pe a thadyn hae paw chitui thuh athua hae paw lu ning nynh thua hae,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Vaetaruhnaw Vizin: Azoupaw Ccakue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bua ka dothung zah a zou cciamangpaw ccakue kha ka muih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te vaawpaw nynh kae kha, “Pawmou na muih?” cite yn khia zah, kae nynh, “A zou cciamangpaw ccakue kha ka muih; tuh-e tuh dong kuin sae zah dong haw ako,” ka cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh aning nynh kae kha, “E hynh ram pynpi kya a thuapaw thyalawnaw nynh thua; a ruhpaw miakaw tuh hynh-e ccakue voikheit lang azeiku thyhte vua athua cih zah, hynhute bya a kinkuhpaw miakaw tuh ccakue voikheit lang azeiku thyhte vua athua cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh, tuh-e ccakue tuh phe ka saw vae zah, miruh inn lungkhu lang te ka min phyate hynhute bya a kinkuhpaw miakaw inn lungkhu lang a tee cih; te tuh-e inn kya a um cih zah, inn kya-e thing te lung ryte inn tuh a roh cih,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Vaesarinaw Vizin: Abawng lungkhu e Nopinung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te bya kae hokuhpaw vaawpaw tuh yn toikuh zah kae kha, “Dothung lah, yn langkuhpaw uccaw khuh dotua,” yn cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae nynh, “Khuh-e khuh pawmou athua?” cite ka khia zah aning nynh, “Oun langkuhpaw abawng bawng kheit nynh thua. E tuh ram pynpi kya um hae paw mih hoyleinaw nynh thua,” yn cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Kuee te raekuhpaw ahu tuh hungkuh zah, abawng lungkhu kya nopinung lu kheit a haung! <verse number="8" style="v" />Te vaawpaw nynh, “E nopinung hynh Hoyleinaw nynh thua,” a ci. Te tuh-e nopinung tuh abawng lungkhu lang nohde zah, abawng kha kuee te raekuhpaw ahu kha a hu. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te ka dothung zah nopi hae lu ning oun pou hae paw kha ka muih. Mih sake kya muisaw a um; minmin tuh kaepaw-pavaw sake alopaw sake kha hoi hae zah, abawng kha laephi te vaawlui laku lang a zoukhae hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh bya kae hokuhpaw vaawpaw kha, “Teilangmou abawng khuh a zoukhae hae?” cite ka khia. <verse number="11" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Abawng hanlan inn sakpya khylan Shinar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Shinar </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ram tuh Babilonia ram nynh thua.</char></note> ram lang nynh a zoukhae hae; inn a paccynpah kou hae te, abawng kha tuin kya nungnawpaw kya a nung cih hae,” yn cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Vaetaryanaw Vizin: Marangle Ccangpali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te bua ka dothung zah sohin mua ccangning laku kyate oun pou hae paw marangle hae ccangpali kha ka muih. <verse number="2" style="v" />Ccangkheitnaw marangle kya asepaw marang hae, ccangningnaw marangle kya amanpaw marang hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:4">Bya 6.4</ref>, <ref loc="REV 6:5">5</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />ccangthumnaw marangle kya arawpaw marang hae, ccangpalinaw marangle kya tuh puakakae lante apyaapaw marang hae a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:2">Bya 6.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Te bya kae hokuhpaw vaawpaw kha, “Ka bawipaw, e hae hynh pawmou athua hae?” cite ka khia. <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaawpaw nynh, “E marangle hae tuh laephi pynpi kya-e <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang te a poupaw, vaawlui khivae ccangpali nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:1">Bya 7.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Amanpaw marang hae kya-e marangle tuh thahlang ram lang a cceih, arawpaw marang hae tuh niccaw ram lang cceih hae zah, apyaapaw marang hae tuh alia ram lang a cceih hae,” yn cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Marang hae he oun pou hae te, laephi kya ccia bungthung lan thawte a zuaku hae. Te vaawpaw nynh, “Cceih oh lah, laephi kya la cceih bungthung oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh laephi kya a cceih bungthung hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te vaawpaw nynh kae kha yn ko zah, “Thahlang ram lang a cceih hae paw nynh ka muisaw kha thahlang ram kya a haeungsah vae hae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Siapharan lang Khangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="10" style="v" />Kyngte cciakhae hae zah Babilon langte oun ki vae hae paw Heldai, Tobijah te Jedaiah kya-e sui te ngun kha suelua hae; tuin nin khe Zefaniah ccapaw Josiah inn lang cciatua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Sui te ngun kha lah lah, bawilukhung kha na rae koute Jehozadak ccapaw ranpibawi lupi Joshua lu kya khungsah tua; <verse number="12" style="v" />te Joshua kyakhe vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: E kya a min Thingkaran cikuhpaw ccungccapaw a um: aning tuh a umnaw hmin kya a toih cih zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn kha a sak cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:5">Jer 23.5</ref>, <ref loc="JER 33:15">33.15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:8">Zek 3.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn a sak cih paw tuh amaw nynh thua; aning tuh siapharan phu-enaw kha a ccou cih zah a bawitungkhung vawlan haungte a uk cih. A bawitungkhung pe khe ranpibawi lu kheit a um cih zah, mih lu ning laku kya daenaw te ngingnaw a um cih. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e bawilukhung tuh Heldai, Tobijah, Jedaiah te Zefaniah ccapaw Josiah nynh a do-oih cih hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn kya liathuinaw uccaw lante a um cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laansaw lang um hae paw tuh oun cceih cih hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn saknaw kya a bawm cih hae; te vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae hynh nae kalan yn saw cipaw na nyh cih oh. Nanning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia bya kha zuakute na zui oh zetuh, e hynh acyihkuh cih.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Athyaruhpaw Looh-aesungnaw Seibenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darias nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum palinaw, Kislev acikuhpaw sawpaw sah takuanaw, nin pali nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Zekhariah kalan yn thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Bethel khuaccaaw hae nynh Sharezer te Regem-melek kha mih ccungccaw hae ryte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thawccinaw kha ngia khylan te <verse number="3" style="v" />vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya umpaw ranpibawi hae te profeh hae kyakhe, “Kum patae rya kae la law vae hawte, sawpaw sah pangawnaw kya rawkhuite looh-aesungte tou kae um ung cih?” cite khia khylan a saw hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="5" style="v" />Ram lungkhu e ccungccaw balyn te ranpibawi hae kha hopah hae: Kum sung sari lungkhu, sawpaw sah pangawnaw te sah sarinaw kya looh-ae na sung oh zah rawkhuite na um vae oh ze, looh-ae na sung oh paw kha kae ka hanlan athua zawtou? <verse number="6" style="v" />Na ae na nia vae oh ze, naemaw hanlan kyalya na ae na neih khyh oh tou? <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem tuh ccungccaw um zah a kaethung lya te a pepan e khua hae, Negeb te Shefelah kya mah ccungccaw a um lya hae ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh langmaw profeh hae kyate a la phypaw bya kha hynh-e bya hae hynh thua khyh tou?</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Kaw-einaw te Detahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Zekhariah kalan yn thua zah a hopaw tuh: <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Hmerarih lan byapia oh, lu kheit te lu kheit ngaethyaumsakunaw te thawccikunaw kha langsakuh oh; <verse number="10" style="v" />nomae hae, ngawraw hae, ramccang ccungccaw hae te ryachi hae kha tuaasah nan oh; lu kheit te lu kheit laku nae thinlung kya ahoy leipaw tuanaw hoikuh nan oh, a ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh ngae ry khyh hae, mih lungkhung zah a thae khyh nawlan hae mih nakaring kha a huku hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />A ccangpyanaw kha thuasah, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a muisaw te langmaw profeh hae kyate a hopaw bya hae kha thuasah a thae khyh nawlan hae mih thinlung kha a khungsahku hae. Tukeiccuze vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate myarya lepaw thin-unaw tuh yn thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ko hae zah a thae khyh hae hawte, minmin nynh yn ko hae zemah ka thae khyh, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci, <verse number="14" style="v" />te minmin nynh a ny lei hae paw minphuin hae balyn laku khe khiccung khate phiariphiarae ka nung hae. Tukeiccuze a cciataw hae paw ram tuh a cceih bungthungpaw lu kheit san a um lei lan ciate ccungccaw phe dae zah, um ry a umpaw ram tuh accakaepaw lang rae athua vae.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Zion kha Byakinpyakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Kae tuh Zion hanlan myaryamaw ka eiung zah, myarya thin-unaw te aning hanlan ka eiung. <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Kae tuh Zion lang ka ki cih zah, Jerusalem kya ka um cih; Jerusalem tuh alungzipaw khuapi cite ko athua cih zah, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mua tuh mua thyaapaw cite ko athua cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nungpi te paawpi hae tuh mih kum myarya a tang vae keiccuze hoitang ccarou ccyngkute Jerusalem laanpi hae kya bua a haung cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Khuapi kya-e laanpi hae tuh a zue hae paw imua nopi pise hae te phe abeih cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Tuh-e tuh atu she kya a laehy hae paw hynh-e ccungccaw hae hanlan athua kho lei lanpaw alo zemah, kae ka hanlan tuh athua kho leipaw alo cih zawtou? cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho. <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Ka ccungccaw hae kha nithua lang e ram te niccaw lang e ram kyate ka khum cih hae zah, <verse number="8" style="v" />Jerusalem kya um khylan ka cciakhae cih hae. Lungzinaw te dingnaw liate minmin tuh ka ccungccaw hae athua cih hae zah kae tuh mih Pachia ka thua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn, beikinn kha sak khylan athonaw kha bing athua lyaze a la um hae paw profeh hae nynh a ho hae paw hynh-e bya hae hynh atu she kya a thae hae paw nanning nynh nae thawsaesakuh oh. <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawccecize tuin ccyh athua maw tuh ccungccaw hae hanlan te sarangpaw hae hanlan ryalaw mee um khyh, a tee hae paw hanlan te a pou hae paw hanlan rhaw hae kyate khynnaw um khyh, ccungccaw hae balyn kha lu kheit te lu kheit ka dousaku hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuasalama a laehypaw hynh-e ccungccaw hae hynh langmawlya hawte ka ccuepe vae lan khyh hae, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungdaete ccacii kha a vua vae cih hae; misu ku nynh athae thae cih, laephi nynh ccathae a pousah cih zah, vaawlui nynh dangtui a ccawsah cih; e uccaw hae balyn hynh a laehypaw hynh-e ccungccaw hae ka ccousah cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pou Judah hae te Israel hae, nanning tuh minphuin ccangpaw hae laku kya thyalawnawpaw lang na la tang oh hawte, nanning kha kae khum cih oh zah hythua ccounawpaw lang na tang cih oh. Rih nan oh, nae thawsae sah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nae minpaaw hae nynh ka thin he yn riasah hae tuh, synpyaku leite nae tungvaw kya ronaw thuasah lan ka paccynku hawte, <verse number="15" style="v" />atu she kya mah Jerusalem te Judah hae tungvaw kya hoynaw rae lan bua ka paccynku; rih nan oh, cite vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. <verse number="16" style="v" />E hae hynh na cyi lan oh paw nynh thua: Lu kheit te lu kheit byaccing kha hokuh oh, nae koikua hae kya ahmete byapia oh lah, daenaw hanlan rae oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:25">Efe 4.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />lu kheit te lu kheit nae thinlung kya ahoy leipaw kha paccynnuakuh nan oh, ahme leipaw byakinkunaw kha ry nan oh; pawccecize hynh-e uccaw hae balyn hynh ka hua, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Lungtua lan umpaw Looh-aesungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah: <verse number="19" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Sawpaw sah palinaw kya looh-aesungnaw, sah pangawnaw kya looh-aesungnaw, sah sarinaw kya looh-aesungnaw te sah hawnaw kya looh-aesungnaw tuh Judah hae hanlan lungtua lungpawnaw poi kha tua ccyh athua cih hae: tukeiccuze byaccing te daenaw kha ry oh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem lang Ccianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Minphuin hae, khuapi patae kya um hae paw tuh oun cceih cih hae; <verse number="21" style="v" />khuapi khuakheit kya um hae paw nynh ccangpaw khua lang a cceih cih hae zah, “Rang oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thawccinaw ngia khylan te vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ccung khylan cceih oh sih; kae mah ka cceih cih,” a ci cih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Ccungccaw patae te athungpaw minphuin hae tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha Jerusalem kya ccung khylan te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thawccinaw kha ngia khylan a cceih cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Tuin nin vae tuh bya aphuinphuin ho hae paw minphuin kya-e pise lu haw nynh Judah ccungccaw lu kheit kha a boeining te a kyng cih hae zah, “Pachia tuh na kya a um cipaw kha kae thae keiccuze nang ryte cceihkheih oh sih,” cite a hopah cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Rhaw hae kha Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hodaebya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 17:1-3">Isa 17.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:23-27">Jer 49.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:3-5">Amo 1.3-5</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.1-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa 23.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Eze 26.1—28.26</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3.4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:21-22">Mat 11.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:13-14">Luk 10.13-14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya nynh Hadrak ram te</para>
  <para style="q2">Damaskas khua kha a rawse cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Israel phin hae balyn kyalya thua leite</para>
  <para style="q2">Siria khuapi kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hadrak ramri a umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Hamath khua mah</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kya-e nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q2">Tair khua te Sidon khua tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">myarya a haw hae zemah</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kya-e nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tair nynh rhawlungrua kha a raeku,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngun kha vuiping hawte</para>
  <para style="q1">pumkuh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sui kha laanpi kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">tuiccua hawte a pumku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama Bawipaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a hoirumnaw kha a lawpah cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">a sisua kha rili lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">a phungpah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuapi kha maee te soi athua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ashkelon khua nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e tuh a muih cih zah a rih cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Gaza khua nynh mah a muih cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">lungriathaete a um cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Ekron khua mah</para>
  <para style="q2">a ngaehoinaw azo keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">tuhcite athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Gaza siapharan tuh azo cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Ashkelon khua kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw um lan khyh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.5-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:29-31">Isa 14.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="JER 47:1-7">Jer 47.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 25:15-17">Eze 25.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4-8">Joe 3.4-8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 1:6-8">Amo 1.6-8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 2:4-7">Zef 2.4-7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ashdod khua kya</para>
  <para style="q2">kaapia hae a um cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">Filistin hae mih lysakunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thangsah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning nynh a aepaw chiise kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a khalang kyate ka lah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">aning nynh a boupaw</para>
  <para style="q2">anungsikuhpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a haw hae laku kyate ka lah cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">a laehypaw ccungccaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ah Pachia hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">a laehypaw athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Judah phin lungkhu e</para>
  <para style="q2">phin kheit hawte athua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">Ekron khuaccaaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Jebus hae hawte athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Humhung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q2">a ccianua bungthung khyh nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka inn kyakhe rhawviatu lante</para>
  <para style="q2">ryahmin ka tahkuh cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuaasahtu nynh minmin kha</para>
  <para style="q2">bua thiing vae lan khyh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ka mit ccaccei te</para>
  <para style="q2">atu phe ka muih vae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Oun Thua Cih paw Uktu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pou Zion ccanung,</para>
  <para style="q2">na lung myarya tua sah!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:5">Mat 21.5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:15">Joh 12.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Jerusalem ccanung,</para>
  <para style="q2">thawte siatua!</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize na siapharan tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na kalan yn cceih cciamang;</para>
  <para style="q1">aning tuh taetu thua zah</para>
  <para style="q2">taenaw te yn cceih,</para>
  <para style="q1">thinlung nepaw thua zah</para>
  <para style="q2">lann tungvaw a ccikuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">lann taraw tungvaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">lann a taw tungvaw ccikute yn cceih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kae nynh Efraim ram kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">marangle kha ka dee cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtuknawpaw marang kha</para>
  <para style="q2">Jerusalem kyate ka dee cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtuknawpaw li kha</para>
  <para style="q2">vua athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">minphuin hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">daenaw bya ka hopah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka uknaw tuh rili ccangkheit kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">rili ccangkheit kyacia</para>
  <para style="q1">a phah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Vawpi kyate laephi</para>
  <para style="q2">adianaw cia a thua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:8">Sam 72.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang na hanlan tuh, nang te ah raekheihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka byakinnaw chiise keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q1">thongccah hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">tui um leinaw laekarung kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ka luesah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Exo 24.8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou ngaehoinaw a hoi hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">thongccah hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">nae rhawlungrua lungkhu lang</para>
  <para style="q2">kithui oh; nanning kha</para>
  <para style="q1">hiin hoynaw leit ning</para>
  <para style="q2">kae pyathui cih oh, cite atunin ka ho vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize Judah kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka li hawte ka koi vae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Efraim kha the lang ka rae vae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Pou Zion, na ccapaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">mih lung ka thosah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">pou Grik, na ccapaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ka dousah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">nang kha rhawkaw thaloi lang</para>
  <para style="q1">kae mang cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh mih tungvaw khe</para>
  <para style="q2">yn langkuh cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a the tuh khozawlaekuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">hawte a kaw cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">Bawipaw PACHIA nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">mungkae a tu cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">alia lang e khiccung ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">a cceih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kha a thungkhaw cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin nynh a roh cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">deihnawpaw lung hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a syde cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mih chii kha misutui hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">a neih cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">pakekhupaw abia hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">abeih cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">silawhang apaki hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ciadadae lan a um cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">minmin kha a khum cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccungccaw hae nynh thua hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">a ram kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q1">bawilukhung kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">aphutepaw lung hawte a aw cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hoynaw te a puithyanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pawcih baban mou ale!</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccathae nynh ccangvae hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">mih thawsaesah cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">misutui thawpaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">liaccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">mih thawsaesah cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Judah te Israel Kithuinaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hawkhuaa araw ccyh kya</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan khuaa kha ngia oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">khise maeking kha rae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">nanning hanlan khuaa a rawsahpaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw miakaw hanlan</para>
  <para style="q2">loo kya aku a posahpaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Terafim khozi hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">accakaepaw bya kha ho hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">apawe hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">akyh leipaw vizin kha a muih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">maansahthya hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">akyh leipaw maan kha sah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">accakaepaw ngaengannaw kha a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Tukeiccuze ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">tuu hae hawte khiavuikuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuurin a um khyh keiccuze a teing hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuurin hae tungvaw ka thinria,</para>
  <para style="q2">cciakhaetu hae kha de ka tah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a tuuphu,</para>
  <para style="q2">Judah hae kha do-oih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">huhan a hoipaw rhawtuknawpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a marang lang a rae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Apaki lang e abyapi huapaw lung thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">bu saknawpaw pangreih thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtuknawpaw li thuasah,</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawbawi miakaw thuasah</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin kyate oun langkuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin tuh rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">laanpi e tuiccua kya a syde hae paw</para>
  <para style="q1">rhawtuknaw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawkaw hae hawte athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh mih kya a um keiccuze,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh rhaw a tuk cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">marang ccikuh hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawkaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">maethya a bong cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae nynh Judah hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thawzung ka pya cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Josef phin hae kha ka khum cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin kha ngaethya</para>
  <para style="q2">ka umsah hae keiccuze ka kikhae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ka vua boi lei hae paw hawte athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize kae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thua zah, mih bya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thaepah cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te Efraim ccungccaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">rhawkaw hae hawte athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">misutui neihpaw hawte mih lungtua cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Mih ccaaw hae nynh tuh-e tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">a muih cih hae zah mih lungpaw cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya mih lungtua cih.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin kha ka shawkhaw vae hae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">syntawnaw pyate ka ko cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">ka suelua cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin tuh atakaw lya</para>
  <para style="q2">a lung hae hawte a lungthui cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minphuin ccangpaw hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phiariphiarae ka nung hae zemah,</para>
  <para style="q1">asawnaw e ram hae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">kae kha yn liathui cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih ccaaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a do-oih cih hae zah a kithui cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Izip ram kyate mih inn lang</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kikhae cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q1">Assiria ram kyate ka suelua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">Gilead ram te Lebanon ram lang</para>
  <para style="q1">ka cciakhae cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin hanlan umnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">azaw lei lan ciate a lung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Riathaenaw rili kha a zua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">rili tuileih kha detah athua cih,</para>
  <para style="q1">Nal vawpi akhunaw balyn tuh arou cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Assiria a lysakunaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">biabung athua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Izip huhan tuh azo cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> liate</para>
  <para style="q2">a thungpaw lang ka rae cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a min liate a cceih cih hae, cite</para>
  <para style="qr">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pou Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q2">na sidar thing hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">maee nynh a u ccaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">na thuakaw hae kha hungtua!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pou maeccaw ku hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">rawtua oh, pawccecize sidar</para>
  <para style="q1">thing hae tuh pu hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">asung-epaw thing hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">aroh vae hae!</para>
  <para style="q2">Bashan kya umpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">rantah thing hae, rawtua oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize myarya lungpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhpi thing hae tuh nge athua vae hae!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuurin hae nynh mih phu-enaw</para>
  <para style="q2">azo keiccuze a raw hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="q2">Jordan vahue a phu-enaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">aro vae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">chindeih hae siaruanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaetua oh!</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Tuurin Phuin Ning</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia nynh hynhte a ho: Chia lanpaw tuuphu kha a rintupaw hawte thuatua oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e tuu hae kha a retu hae nynh a chia hae zemah detahnaw teing khyh hae; a zuatu hae nynh, “Kae tuh ka hoirum vae keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh thehoyte um sah,” a ci hae; minmin a rintu hae tuurin hae maw nynh tuu hae kha ngaethyaumsah khyh hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram lungkhu um hae paw kha ngaethya ka umsah vae lan khyh hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci. Ccungccaw miakaw kha mih innpaw kuih kalan te mih siapharan kuih kalan ka ap cih hae; tuh-e hae nynh ram kha a roh cih hae zah, mih kuih kyate lu kheit sanmah ka luesah lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuu te kungku hae paw ccelang, kae tuh chia lanpaw tuu hae kha a rintupaw lang ka tang. Hoitang ccangning kha ka law; ccangkheit kha Thawccinaw cite min ka phu zah, ccangpaw ccangkheit kha Lungngingnaw cite min ka phu, te tuu hae kha ka rin hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Sawpaw sah kheit lungkhu tuurin lu thum kha ka vua hae, pawccecize mih tungvaw ka ngaesang kho vae khyh, minmin nynh mah kae kha yn hua hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te kae nynh, “Kae tuh nanning ae rintu oh paw ka thua vae lan khyh. A chih cih paw tuh chih sah; ro athua cih paw tuh roh sah; a laehy hae paw tuh sa kheit te sa kheit aekuh hae sah!” cite ka ho. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae balyn ryte ka raepaw byakinnaw kha rote, Thawccinaw cikuhpaw ka hoitang kha ka lah zah ka khya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuin nin khe tuh-e byakinnaw tuh ro thua zah, kae yn do hae paw, tuu te kungku hae paw nynh tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya nynh thua cipaw a ny hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te kae nynh minmin kha, “Ahoy na ci oh ze, ka ryalaw mee yn pya oh; na ci khyh oh ze yn pya nan oh,” ka cipya hae. Tukeiccuze ka ryalaw mee lang ngunphua shekel sung thum kha a tou hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:15">Mat 26.15</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:9-10">Mat 27.9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, “Khah-e ngunphua kha sisua bawng lungkhu lang vuatua,” yn cipya. Ka mee yn khyanaw hae paw ngunphua myarya lungpaw shekel sung thum kha ka lah zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya umpaw sisua bawng lungkhu lang ka vua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh Judah te Israel laku uno kyngkunaw kha rote, Lungngingnaw cikuhpaw ccangningnaw ka hoitang kha ka khya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha yn hopah zah: Ccungkia leipaw tuurinpaw kya-e uccaw hae kha bua lawtua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawccecize ram lungkhu kya tuurin lu kheit kha ka langsakuh cih, aning nynh vyavya chihpaw tuu hae kha pawlangria lan khyh, laanpi a vae paw tuu kha ccung lan khyh, vaemaw a muepaw kha dansah lan khyh, adanpaw tuu kha looh dang lan khyh, thuasalama athopaw tuu hae kha tuh mih ccumakeih kha a zu cih zah a ae cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuuphu a ccuetawpaw, ccungkia leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tuurin hanlan ngaethya lan kou um!</para>
  <para style="q1">A kuih te a ranglang mit kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thaloi nynh ccawphu vae sah!</para>
  <para style="q1">A kuih tuh khaleih rou sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a ranglang mit tuh marae moh sah! a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem nynh Taenaw</para>
  <para style="d">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hodaebya.</para>
  <para style="p">Israel te asekuhpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya: Vaawlui kha tharae daw zah laephi kha mah rae zah ccungccaw lungkhu kya muisaw a raetupaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: <verse number="2" style="v" />Dotua, Jerusalem tuh a pepan umpaw minphuin hae hanlan ruinawpaw banang lang ka rae cih; Jerusalem kha he a koihlu hae te, Judah kha mah a koihlu cih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Jerusalem kha minphuin hae balyn hanlan aripaw lungtung lang ka rae cih; tuh-e lungtung a hang hae paw balyn tuh mimaw toulou kha vaemaw a muesakuh cih hae. Laephi vaw e minphuin hae balyn tuh Jerusalem dou khylan pynkheihlan a sueluakuh cih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh, tuin nin khe marang miakaw kha ka siisakuh cih hae zah, a ccikuh hae paw kha ka ngaeesah cih hae. Thuasalama Judah hae kha tuh ka do-oih cih hae, minphuin ccangpaw hae kya-e marang miakaw kha mih mit ka mohsah cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh Judah phin hae nynh, “Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia liate thawzung a hoi hae,” cite a hokuh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Judah phin hae tuh maeething pumnuapaw maeephupi hawte thuasah, loohcce hae laku aruapaw maee hawte thuasah ka thuasah cih hae; minmin nynh mih pepan voilang ranglang umpaw minphuin hae balyn kha a roh cih hae, Jerusalem khua tuh amaw umnaw hmin, Jerusalem kya mawkhe bua a um cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David ciihan hae phu-enaw te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae phu-enaw tuh Judah phu-enaw laeze hangthung athua khyh nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Judah rhawkaw hae kha taenaw a pyaty cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kha a thungkhaw cih hae, tuhteze nynh minmin laku e thawzung zya hae paw tuh tuin nin khe David hawte thuasah, David ciihan hae tuh Pachia hawte thuasah, mih malang umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw hawte thuasah athua cih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Jerusalem dou khylan oun cceih hae paw minphuin hae balyn kha ro khylan ka ccung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thuingpaw hanlan Rawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David ciihan te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae tungvaw kya ngaethyaumsahnaw thinlung te sawsang rynaw thinlung kha ka bu cih, tuhteze nynh minmin nynh a thuing hae paw ccungccapaw kha he a do hae te, lu kheit kyalyapaw ccaaw hanlan a rahpaw hawte, tuh-e paw hanlan a rah cih hae, ccatawccaw hanlan a rahpaw hawte, tuh-e paw hanlan thawte a rah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:37">Joh 19.37</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Bya 1.7</ref></char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.10-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat 24.30</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Bya 1.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh Jerusalem khua e rawnaw tuh Megiddo accya kya umpaw Hadad-rimmon hanlan rawnaw ciate ale cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram tuh a rah cih, innbyn raveih tuh mawmaw raveihte a rah cih hae; David ciihan kya-e innbyn tuh amaw taekhiate, mih zu hae tuh mimaw taekhiate a rah cih hae; Nathan ciihan kya-e innbyn tuh amaw taekhiate, mih zu hae tuh mimaw taekhiate a rah cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Levi ciihan kya-e innbyn tuh amaw taekhiate, mih zu hae tuh mimaw taekhiate a rah cih hae; Shimei innbyn tuh amaw taekhiate, mih zu hae tuh mimaw taekhiate a rah cih hae; <verse number="14" style="v" />te tuhlaepaw innbyn hae tuh mawmaw innbyn raveihte, mih zu hae tuh mimaw taekhiate a rah cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin nin khe David ciihan te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae mih seinaw te mih nungsikunaw kha ccikan nawlan tuidy ccangkheit aphyh cih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zohtuh Beiknaw Vuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh, tuin nin khe zohtuh hae min kha liathui athua vae khyh nawlan ram kyate ka vua cih; profeh hae te athyaa leipaw muisaw hae kha mah ram kyate ka vua cih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Profeh lukhakheit tuh bua yn langku lanze, amaw a saahkuhtu hae a nung te a paaw nynh, “Nang tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te hynbya na ho keiccuze na hiin vae lan khyh,” cite a hopah cih hae zah, profehbya a ho lyakhe a saahkuhtu hae a nung te a paaw nynh amaw kha po zua lan a thuing cih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh profeh hae tuh profehbya a ho vae hae ze, minmin lu kheit cci nynh a muih hae paw mih vizin keiccu mih maethah cih; milae kha ling khylan saming angkiccua kha kikuh vae lan khyh hae, <verse number="5" style="v" />minmin lu kheit cci nynh, “Kae tuh profeh ka thua khyh, loophopaw nynh ka thua; ka di lya mawte laephi te a vuekuakuhpaw nynh ka thua,” cite a ho cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te lukhakheit nynh, “Na by kya-e vaemaw hynh paw keiccu mou athua?” cite a khia hae ze, “Ka ban hae inn kya ka muepaw vaemaw nynh thua,” cite a khung cih hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Tuurin Detahnaw, Tuu hae Phiakunaw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pou thaloi, kae te ryalahkheihpaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ka tuurinpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">rawsete thonuaku tua, cite</para>
  <para style="qr">Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">Tuu hae tuh phiariphiarae a um ccaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">tuurinpaw kha ziatua;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuu taraw hae kha rawsete</para>
  <para style="q2">ka kuih ka maeleihnua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:31">Mat 26.31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27">Mar 14.27</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q2">ram pynpi kya</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw pum thum pum ning kha</para>
  <para style="q2">vuate ro athua cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">pum thum pum kheit tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a laehy cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Te pum thum pum kheit tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">maee lungkhu ka nung cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngun kha thyaasah hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ka thyaasah cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">sui kha syntawtua hawte</para>
  <para style="q2">ka syntawtua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Minmin nynh ka min kha</para>
  <para style="q2">yn ko cih hae zah ka oi cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Kae nynh, “Minmin tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ka ccungccaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">thua hae,” cite ka ho cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">minmin nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">kae Pachia nynh thua,” cite a ho cih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Malang Ccyh Rhawtuknaw te Nyathya Taenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccyh tuh anae vae, tuin ccyh kyakhe ae luade oh paw nae uccaw kha nae malang khe a neekuh cih hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem kha tuk khylan minphuin hae balyn kha ka suelua cih hae zah khuapi kha a lah cih hae, inn hae kha a luade cih hae zah nopi hae kha kyngdete a ikhae cih hae; khuaccaaw hae angankuh kha kyngte a cciakhae cih hae, thuasalama a laehy hae paw kha tuh khuapi kyate vua thua lan khyh hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh yn toikuh cih zah, rhaw a tuk nin lya hawte khah-e minphuin hae kha a tuk cih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh a ccu tuh Jerusalem nithua lang umpaw Oliv Mua vawlan a thadyn cih; Oliv Mua tuh nithua lang te niccaw lang cia ccangning lang akoi cih zah myarya kopaw accya lang a tang cih; tetuh Mua angankuh tuh thahlang a nuekuh cih zah, angankuh tuh alia lang a nuekuh cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mua accya kin te na ccue cih oh, pawccecize mua hae laku e accya tuh Azal cia aphah cih; Judah siapharan Uzziah ccyh lyaze innrysuekuhpaw kyate na ccue lya oh hawte na ccue cih oh. Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia tuh a mithyaa hae balyn ryte oun cceih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh khuaccih te dangtui mah um vae lan khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuadae kyalya po a um cih (tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a nyh), khuazi te khuadae cite um vae lan khyh, pawccecize zete ccyh kya awnaw a um cih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh Jerusalem kyate hiinnaw tui apou cih, tuh-e tui angankuh tuh nithua lang e rili kalan alua cih zah, angankuh tuh niccaw lang e rili kalan alua cih; hawnin te khuaccih kya po alua cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Eze 47.1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:38">Joh 7.38</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:1">Bya 22.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh laephi pynpi kya siapharan lang a tang cih; tuin nin vae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ccangkheit kyalyapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, a min minkheit kyalyapaw min athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram pynpi tuh Geba khua kyate Jerusalem alia lang e Rimmon khua kyacia bialae lang rae athua cih. Thuasalama Jerusalem tuh a umnaw hmin kya po umte hangthung athua cih zah, Benjamin Koikua kyate langmawlya e koikua hmin kyacia, Apaki Koikua kyacia, Hananel Innhangpaw kyate Siapharan misu mianaw khu kyacia athua cih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem tuh ccungccaw a um cih zah, ronaw kha kharouh teing vae lan khyh; khyndadyh lan a um cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:3">Bya 22.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerusalem a doutu minphuin hae balyn kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynh-e shethya hynh a thuasah cih: Mih ccu te a thadyn lya hae mawkhe mih ngesaw athuh cih; mih mitkarung lungkhu e mih mit tuh athuh cih zah, mih khalang lungkhu e mih lae tuh athuh cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn sawpaw siikunaw alepaw nynh minmin kha a thuanua cih hae, mimaw te mimaw a kyngkuh cih hae zah, lu kheit te lu kheit rhawkute a theihkuh cih hae; <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah hae nynh heize Jerusalem kya rhaw a tuk cih hae. A pepan e minphuin hae sisua kha luadete suelua athua cih—sui, ngun te boeining patae kha suelua athua cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhcihawpaw shethya tuh rhaw hae kya-e ryahmin hae kya um hae paw marang hae, lann dihpaw hae, kalauh hae, lann hae te sarangpaw miakaw kya a thua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Jerusalem a doutu hae kya-e a hiinhy hae paw tuh Siapharan, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha beik khylan te bu poi kha tua khylan kum takyhte Jerusalem lang a cceih cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Siapharan, vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha beik khylan Jerusalem lang a cceihthung leipaw laephi vaw e minphuin ccangkhakheit a um lanze, tuh-e hae tungvaw kya khuaarah lan khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Izip hae nynh cciathung leite khuapi lungkhu lang a tee khyh hae ze, bu poi tua lan a cceihthung leipaw minphuin hae tungvaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a thuasahpaw shethya tuh mih tungvaw kya a thua cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhcihawpaw shethya tuh bu poi tua khylan a cceihthung leipaw minphuin hae tungvaw te Izip tungvaw kya detahnaw a thua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh marang khinling hae vawlan khe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan athyaapaw,” cite zei athua cih. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya umpaw ang hae tuh silawhang malang umpaw pakekhupaw hae hawte athyaa cih hae; <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerusalem te Judah ram kya umpaw ang hae tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan a thyaa cih hae, tuhteze nynh silawtu balyn tuh oun thua cih hae zah, silawnawpaw saw kha thung nawlan tuh-e ang hae tuh a mang cih hae. Tuin nin kyate tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya kungku hae paw um vae lan khyh hae.</para>
</usx>